  [ 10] lteq
  [ 11] jmpifz [ 35] ............................ repeat with i = 10 to 50
  [ 14] getlocal 0 .............................. <i>
  [ 16] pusharglist 1 ........................... <i>
  [ 18] extcall 14 .............................. <sprite(i)>
  [ 20] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 23] setobjprop 15 ........................... sprite(i).visible = 1
  [ 25] pushint8 1
  [ 28] getlocal 0
  [ 30] add
  [ 31] setlocal 0
